			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance submodules — Consolidate request ID generation and remove dead Git wrappers\n\n**Air** (refactor): Replace the local `GenerateRequestID` module in AirServiceProvider with direct calls to `crate::Utility::GenerateRequestId()`. Update all 15 service method modules to use the shared utility function, eliminating redundant indirection.\n\n**Mountain** (refactor): Delete the dead `Git::Shared::Removed` wrapper module and replace calls with direct `uuid::Uuid::new_v4()` invocations in Git service handlers. Remove unused `Air` and `Cache` re-exports from `Library.rs` and the `Client` re-export from `Vine/mod.rs`.\n\nBoth submodules continue the absolute-path migration and elimination of wrapper modules, ensuring direct delegation to canonical utility and library definitions.",
