			"Message": "refactor(Land): Advance Mountain submodule — Eliminate final Vine re-exports and complete absolute-path migration\n\nRemove the deprecated `Generated` and `Client` module re-exports from `Mountain/Source/Vine/mod.rs`, completing the migration to absolute-path delegation for the gRPC protocol layer. Update `Source/Vine/Server/Initialize.rs` and `MountainVinegRPCService.rs` to import `::Vine::Generated` types directly.\n\nRefactor 90+ `Source/RPC/CocoonService` handler files across Auth, Command, FileSystem, Provider, Window, Workspace, and Terminal services to replace `crate::Vine::Generated` with `::Vine::Generated`. Also delete the final wrapper modules in `Source/Air/mod.rs`, `Source/Cache/mod.rs`, and `Source/Vine/Server/Notification/Support/mod.rs`, updating `AirClientWrapper.rs` and `GetOrCreateAirClient.rs` to import `::AirLibrary::Client::AirClient` directly.\n\nImpact: Mountain's IPC and service layers now delegate exclusively to canonical Vine/Cache/Air library crates with zero local re-export indirection. The absolute-path migration is complete across all three dependency boundaries.",
